DESCRIPTION:On October 27th\, Israeli citizens go to the polls for the firs
 t time since the October 2023 Hamas attack and the years of war that have 
 followed in Gaza\, Lebanon and Iran. Dr. Dahlia Scheindlin\, Israel's fore
 most public opinion expert\, will analyze the results of this fateful elec
 tion and their implications for the future of the country and the region.
