DESCRIPTION:Join us on Wednesday\, September 9\, from 9:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m
 . for the Interdisciplinary Research Sandbox\, hosted by the Sustainabilit
 y Research Institute (SRI) in partnership with the REACH Center\, the Reds
 tone Global Center (RGC)\, the Global Food Institute\, and the Trustworthy
  AI Initiative.\n\nWe look forward to facilitating discussions around topi
 cs including: \n\nHealth and extreme weatherDisplacement and migrationHuma
 nitarian aid and disaster responseLand use and developmentEnergy\, technol
 ogy\, and infrastructureCommunity-based researchFood\, agriculture\, and n
 utritionClimate communications and misinformationAI in systems and for soc
 ietyResearchers from all disciplines welcome.\n\nWhat to Expect\n\nThe San
 dbox will be a dynamic mix of networking\, big-idea brainstorming\, and co
 llaborative planning. Together\, we’ll work toward developing new resear
 ch concepts\, forming teams\, and exploring ways to spark ongoing\, cross-
 disciplinary research collaborations.\n\nPre-Work \n\nTo make the most of 
 our time together\, please come prepared with 1-2 “big ideas” you’d 
 love to see come to life. Craft each idea into a single\, compelling phras
 e that invites collaboration. For example: \n\n"Decarbonizing diets to imp
 rove health and planetary resilience"\n\n"Resilient regional food hubs for
  climate-ready nutrition"\n\nWhen crafting your phrase\, think about how y
 our idea could naturally involve multiple disciplines or areas of expertis
 e. These ideas will form the foundation of our brainstorming sessions and 
 help us shape actionable research topics during the event. Think big and b
 e bold!\n\nEvent Details\n\nDate: Wednesday\, September 9Time: 9:00 a.m.
 –1:00 p.m.Location: Lindner Family Commons (Room 602)\, Elliott School o
 f International AffairsLunch: ProvidedBring: Your laptop and a writing ute
 nsilIf you have any questions\, please feel free to reach out to us. \n\nR
 egister Here: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScLvqUGfE5BK0C0OtWM
 ndlxEG8LMmsGvbO6obs-vASekkaKOg/viewform?usp=header
GEO:38.896484;-77.025126
LOCATION:Lindner Family Commons\, Room 602\, at the Elliott School of Inter
 national Affairs\, 602
SUMMARY:Interdisciplinary Research Sandbox
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.gwu.edu/event/sustainability-research-sandbo
 x
