DTEND:20260923T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join Professor Alexa Alice Joubin\, professor of English\, WGSS
 \, theatre\, international affairs\, and East Asian languages and cultures
 \, for an illustrated presentation on the Taiwanese film As We Like It (Ji
 eda huanxi\, 2021) and discover the latest in women’s cinema.\n\nAbout t
 he Event\n\nWomen’s cinema encompasses female-led films or narratives th
 at focus on women’s experiences. It also includes films that target fema
 le audiences. As We Like It is an important milestone for Taiwanese women
 ’s cinema. Shot on the heels of the 2019 legalization of same-sex marria
 ge in Taiwan\, As We Like It envisions a post-gender future. Taiwan was th
 e first country in Asia to legalize same-sex marriage\, initiating a new m
 ode of coalition politics. \n\nThe all-female cast does away with such bin
 ary gender accessories as mustaches or wigs. It presents characters of all
  genders (played by actors identifying as women) matter-of-factly without 
 apology or additional justification. Thematizing mixed-race and transgende
 r practices\, the queer film (in Mandarin\, Taiwanese\, and French) presen
 ts gender as a translational practice. \n\nGender becomes legible or illeg
 ible in new ways when translated into different languages. It is commonly 
 assumed that some ideas are lost in translation. We can instead think of t
 ransness and translation as a concept through which embodied experiences e
 volve into social signs for interpretation.\n\nDoors will open no sooner t
 han 15 minutes before the start time.\n\nThe Elliott School can coordinate
  with the university to reasonably accommodate most disabilities. If you n
 eed specific accommodations\, please contact the Sigur Center at gsigur@gw
 u.edu. Requests should be made as soon as possible\, but at least three da
 ys prior to the program to ensure accommodation.
GEO:38.896188;-77.044206
LOCATION:1957 E Street NW\, Chung-wen Shih Asian Studies Conference Room
SUMMARY:Humanities in Asia: Women’s Trans Cinema in Taiwan: “As We Like
  It”
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.gwu.edu/event/humanities-in-asia-womens-tran
 s-cinema-in-taiwan-as-we-like-it
CATEGORIES:Academic
