DESCRIPTION:Get GOIN- hosted by the Office for Study Abroad\, the Center fo
 r Career Services\, and the Office of Alumni Relations — provides an opp
 ortunity for current GW undergraduate students to connect with study abroa
 d returnees as well as notable alumni who enhanced their professional prof
 ile by highlighting their experiences abroad. \n\nThis event is not specif
 ic to any one career-path or school\, but rather an opportunity for you to
